DESCRIPTION:Quantified self is a cultural trend of self-tracking that inco
 rporates technology and data acquisition into daily life\, often with the 
 goal of improving physical and mental health or to improve performance. Th
 e widespread use of wearables that track fitness\, health\, and sleep have
  enabled more individuals who seek "self-knowledge through numbers” to e
 ngage in quantified self techniques for disease management and wellness.\n
 \n \n\nEpistemic Agency — Empowering Individual Health Discovery with AI
 \n\nSpe\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://wearable.su.domains/the-quantif
